ext::verify(&mut self, cnx_id: &ConnectionId) -> Option<u64>` — todo!()\n   - `Quic::set_lb_cid_config(&mut self, lb_config: &Config) -> Result<(), Error>` — todo!()\n   - `Quic::clear_lb_cid_config(&mut self)` — todo!()\n\n- **`rs/fq/src/tls_api.rs`** (grep)\n   - `setup_test_aead_context(_is_encrypt: bool, _secret: &[u8], _prefix_label: &str) -> Option<Box<dyn crate::tls::PacketKey>>`\n   - `pn_enc_create_for_test(_secret: &[u8], _prefix_label: &str) -> Option<Box<dyn crate::tls::HeaderKey>>`\n\n- **`rs/fq/src/qlog.rs`** (read) — Only has `Quic::set_qlog`; needs `qlog_frames` added\n\n- **`rs/fq/src/binlog.rs`** (read, first 80 lines) — Detailed binlog infrastructure; needs `CidSet`, `list_cids`, `svg_convert` added\n\n- **`picoquictest/skip_frame_test.c`** (read lines 374-432)\n   - `test_skip_list[]` has ~40 entries: `TEST_SKIP_ITEM(\"padding\", ...), TEST_SKIP_ITEM(\"reset_stream\", ...) ...`\n   - `nb_test_skip_list` is the count\n\n- **`rs/fq/tests/fixtures/`** — Only has `config_usage_ref.txt`; need to add `qlog_frames_test_ref.txt`\n\n4. Errors and Fixes:\n- No errors encountered yet (still in the research/planning phase, no code written)\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n- **Borrow conflict for `predict_packet_header_length` and `create_packet_header`**: These methods take both `&mut self` (Connection) and `&mut PacketContextState`/`&mut Path`, which would create double mutable borrow if the context/path is obtained from the same connection. Resolution: add path0-specific wrapper methods (`predict_header_length_for_ptype`, `create_packet_header_path0`) that avoid the conflict by operating on internal state directly.\n- **Borrow conflict for `queue_for_retransmit`**: Takes `&mut Path` but path is typically `cnx->path[0]`. Resolution: add `queue_for_retransmit_path0` wrapper.\n- **`PacketHeader` construction**: The struct has no `Default` impl and has `Instant` fields. Resolution: add a manual `Default` impl using `ConnectionId::with_size(0)`, `Epoch::Initial`, `Packe